OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIsolated
OL,6,Fheavy showers or thunderstorms are
OL,7,Fpossible this evening, especially in
OL,8,Fthe south. Turning increasingly dry
OL,9,Fovernight with clear periods. A cooler
OL,10,Ffeeling night than recently, but still
OL,11,Frather warm and humid for a time.
OL,12,FWinds remaining mainly light.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FLargely dry with sunny
OL,15,Fspells and patchy cloud. Feeling
OL,16,Ffresher than recent days with a gentle
OL,17,Fnortherly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
