OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunday
OL,6,Fand Monday, largely dry with bright or
OL,7,Fsunny spells. Mainly light winds.
OL,8,FCloudier and breezier on Tuesday, with
OL,9,Fa chance of rain or showers.
OL,10,FTemperatures nearer to average.
